              "default": "The Lithuanian Register of Legal Acts (TAR) is served as open data via the data.gov.lt Spinta API (dataset gov/lrsk/teises_aktai/Dokumentas, CC BY 4.0). Acts are addressed by their TAR code (tar_kodas, e.g. '2014-21296'); discover acts with lt_search (matches the title). Full text is in the tekstas_lt field. Language: Lithuanian.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "date_adopted": {
